   328	                         * cleaner implementation of the driver's match_card and init,
   329	                         * which should normally *not* modify the card object if
   330	                         * unsuccessful. However, after years of relentless hacking, reality
   331	                         * is different: The card object is changed in virtually every card
   332	                         * driver so in order to prevent unwanted interaction, we reset the
   333	                         * card object here and hope that the card driver at least doesn't
   334	                         * allocate any internal ressources that need to be freed. If we
   335	                         * had more time, we should refactor the existing code to not
